# In Today a completed entry stays (dimmed with ✔) until the user hides completed blocks with Ctrl+O.
file <<END
Work:
	- Pay rent @due({today-1})
	- Send report @due({today})
END
keys gt x
see ✔ Pay rent
keys <C-o>
see - Send report
hide Pay rent
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Pay rent @due({today-1}) @done({today})
	- Send report @due({today})
END
